OL,3,C'Gel nail ban': What are the new rules?
OL,5,FOver the weekend, new regulations came
OL,6,Finto force, changing what nail polish
OL,7,Fpeople will be able to use.
OL,9,FThe so-called "gel nail ban" has
OL,10,Fprompted questions from manicure
OL,11,Flovers about whether their favourite
OL,12,Ftreatments are set to disappear from
OL,13,Fsalons.
OL,15,FBut in reality, the changes are more
OL,16,Flimited and focus on one specific
OL,17,Fchemical used in some gel polishes.
OL,19,FSo what exactly is changing, and what
OL,20,Fdoes it mean for your next manicure?
OL,21,FITV News explains.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
