FL,316,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1787006889
OL,3,C'Gel nail ban': What are the new rules?
OL,5,FThe chemical has been banned in the
OL,6,FEuropean Union since September 1 last
OL,7,Fyear, meaning that nail technicians
OL,8,Fcould not use products containing the
OL,9,Fsubstance on clients after this date.
OL,11,FHere, TPO is being phased out at a
OL,12,Fslower pace. The ingredient ban came
OL,13,Finto effect on Saturday, meaning
OL,14,Fmanufacturers can no longer sell new
OL,15,Fproducts containing TPO.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1787006889
OL,3,C'Gel nail ban': What are the new rules?
OL,5,FHowever, the off-the-shelf deadline is
OL,6,FValentine's Day next year. This means
OL,7,Fthat gel manicure services will
OL,8,Fcontinue as normal, with salons able
OL,9,Fto use existing TPO stock until
OL,10,Fsupplies run out - they just won't be
OL,11,Fable to buy new stock containing the
OL,12,Fingredient.
OL,14,FWhere does the ban apply?
OL,16,FThe ban applies in England, Wales and
OL,17,FScotland. The ban is already in force
OL,18,Fin the EU. The product can still be
OL,19,Fused in the US, Australia and Asia.
OL,21,FWhy has TPO been banned?
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
