OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1787006889
OL,3,C'Gel nail ban': What are the new rules?
OL,5,FThe ban comes off the back of a new
OL,6,Fsafety classification, as studies on
OL,7,Fanimals linked high consumption of the
OL,8,Fproduct to fertility and reproductive
OL,9,Fissues.
OL,11,FCaroline Rainsford, Director of
OL,12,FScience at The Cosmetic, Toiletry and
OL,13,FPerfumery Association (CTPA),
OL,14,Fexplains: "The reason why TPO has been
OL,15,Fbanned in cosmetic products in the EU
OL,16,Fis based on its hazardous properties,
OL,17,Fmeaning how a substance might behave
OL,18,Funder a 'worst case' situation when
OL,19,Four bodies are exposed to a very large
OL,20,Famount."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,000,100
