SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1787006889
OL,3,C'Gel nail ban': What are the new rules?
OL,5,FHowever, she continues, "the amount of
OL,6,Fthis ingredient used in nail products
OL,7,Fis over a thousand times less than the
OL,8,Famount which could have any negative
OL,9,Feffect on fertility, and these
OL,10,Fproducts are applied to the nail, so
OL,11,Fthe potential for the ingredient to be
OL,12,Fabsorbed into our bodies is even
OL,13,Fsmaller."
OL,15,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,16,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,17,Fcoverage from ITV Wales, sent direct
OL,18,Fto your inbox every Saturday morning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/10
