OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1787006889
OL,3,C'Gel nail ban': What are the new rules?
OL,5,FThe Cosmetic, Toiletry and Perfumery
OL,6,FAssociation (CTPA) worked with the
OL,7,FNational Hair & Beauty Federation
OL,8,F(NHBF) and trading standards to
OL,9,Fdevelop guidance on TPO.
OL,11,FWhen a chemical has a particular
OL,12,Fclassification under the CLP chemicals
OL,13,Flaw, it must meet "a strictJset of
OL,14,Fcriteria" to continue being used as a
OL,15,Fcosmetic ingredient, they say.
OL,17,F"Despite its safety as a cosmetic
OL,18,Fingredient, the industry could not
OL,19,Fmeet the two other requirements (lack
OL,20,FofJalternatives and presence in food),
OL,21,Fmeaning that TPO is being banned."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
