OL,3,C'Gel nail ban': What are the new rules?
OL,5,FWhat will nail technicians use instead?
OL,7,FTPO-Free gels already exist, and many
OL,8,Fbrands already use them. While some
OL,9,Falternatives may belong to the same
OL,10,Fchemical family, different compounds
OL,11,Fhave different safety ratings.
OL,13,FTraditional air-dried polishes do not
OL,14,Fneed to contain TPO.
OL,16,FHow will it be regulated?
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
