OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1787006889
OL,3,C'Gel nail ban': What are the new rules?
OL,5,FAlthough it is currently unclear how
OL,6,Fthe law will be regulated, Richard
OL,7,FKnight, Trading Standards Lead Officer
OL,8,Ffor Cosmetics and Beauty, says:
OL,9,F"Anyone who wishes to report any
OL,10,Fsuspected illegal cosmetic product,
OL,11,Fincluding nail gels, can alert Trading
OL,12,FStandards via the government-funded
OL,13,FCitizens' Advice Consumer Helpline."
OL,15,FHow can I check whether my gel
OL,16,Fproducts contain TPO?
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
