OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1787006889
OL,3,C'Gel nail ban': What are the new rules?
OL,5,FTo check whether your nail varnish
OL,6,Fcontains TPO, you can check the full
OL,7,Fchemical name "trimethylbenzoyl
OL,8,Fdiphenylphosphine oxide" on the bottle
OL,9,For packaging, under ingredients.
OL,11,FIt is unlikely the chemical will be
OL,12,Flisted by its shortened name "TPO".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/10
